# Nothing generated is committed. A fresh clone must build.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
web/e2e/out/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
dist/
build/
target/
.env
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Host-specific detail never lands here. See deploy/HOSTING.local.md.
deploy/HOSTING.local.md
*.local.md
# Any host-local file, not only markdown. A copy of the box's nginx carries
# every vhost on it and their ports, and *.local.md did not match it: the
# trimmed apex config was staged for a public repo once before this line
# existed.
*.local
*.local.*
!docs/**/*.local.md

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# The archival drip writes outside the checkout by default (TM_ARCHIVE, or
# systemd's $STATE_DIRECTORY). These are belt and braces for the case where
# somebody points TM_ARCHIVE at the tree for a one-off run: what comes down is
# three gigabytes of CC BY-NC-SA content that must not be redistributed from a
# public repo. See NOTICE.md and projects/6502/archive/README.md.
# Anchored and named, NOT a bare `archive/`. That was the first version and it
# matched projects/6502/archive/, silently untracking the tool along with its
# output: `git status` simply stopped mentioning the files. Caught with
# `git check-ignore -v` before the commit, which is the only way to see it.
/archive/
wayback/
cdx-full/
**/archive/cdx/
**/archive/files/

# Generated from style/tokens.css by style/build-icon.py on every build.
# Committing them would make the icon a second copy of the palette, and a tab
# icon one revision behind the tokens looks exactly like a tab icon.
# Generated by web/scripts/build-sw.mjs, stamped with the commit, because a
# browser installs a new worker only when the file's bytes change.
web/public/sw.js
# Generated by style/build-icon.py from the palette, like the icons above.
web/public/icons/
# Generated by web/scripts/build-lab.mjs from the 6502 checkout's Lab.
web/public/6502/lab/
# The console's modules, read from the 6502 checkout at build time by
# web/scripts/pull-console.mjs with three lines patched (lib/console-modules.ts)
# and a manifest naming the upstream commit. They were committed copies until
# 2026-08-26, with no recorded base and two CC BY-NC-SA ROMs among them.
# NOTICE.md is this site's own text about the terms and stays.
web/public/6502/games/*
!web/public/6502/games/NOTICE.md

web/app/icon.svg
web/app/apple-icon.png
web/app/favicon.ico

# The owner's style-guide material, in flight (a zip and photographs).
# Ignored so `deploy.sh`'s add -A cannot publish it to a public repository as
# a side effect of shipping something else. Publishing it is a decision:
# remove this line and commit deliberately when the guide is ready.
docs/styles/

# Pulled from the 6502 tree at build time by web/scripts/pull-chipdocs.mjs:
# generated documents, and schematics that are CC BY-NC-SA die-trace data
# this public repository must not redistribute. The site serves them from
# build output; git never carries them.
docs/6502/atlas.md
docs/6502/idioms.md
docs/6502/walk-snake.md
web/public/6502/chipdocs/
docs/6502/findings-answers.md

# The console-shell handoff pack: its sources/ carry third-party IP and are mood only.
docs/nes-arcade-handoff-v0.1
docs/nes-arcade-handoff-*.zip

# Generated sheets (scripts/shell-sheets.ts)
web/out/
notes/stash/
